The interest for the alchemist into the material world comes from the idea that there is something in matter, something in materials and things that needs to be freed. There's a spirit. Things can transform.

00:15:27.615 --> 00:15:51.304
This is an idea of turning lead into gold, that there is potentiality in material things. And this is the foundation of natural sciences and the view or the scientific view of today to investigate matter, to change matter and bring it into another form to make it reveal its potential.

