But the alchemical idea is that human beings bring the salvation to material things and the material world by freeing this potential, by turning lead into gold through transformation, which we do today by turning sand into semiconductors, as an example.

00:18:11.918 --> 00:18:32.781
So the alchemist, weird bunch, no school, they did not take any pupils, extremely solitary, and this will be important later on. So people just toiling away and looking at flames and all those stuff. So what for us is now pretty normal to accept that things are different.

