00:20:51.053 --> 00:21:12.415
And this is a comparative science, similar as you can do it in literature by taking, for example, works of a certain period, uh, to analyze what is common for this period, the underlying ideas. So if it's like Romanticism or naturalism and so on, and you can see it also in artworks.

00:21:14.848 --> 00:21:26.483
