It's not found initially. So it's like found but disregarded, and it takes a long time to be recognized the lapis. So a lot of contradictory ideas. And in the center of this magnum opus and the alchemical work is of course the alchemical process.

00:25:43.290 --> 00:26:03.227
So this idea of very often four things, also very important, of four things being combined. So we have this idea of earth, air, fire, water, which is coming from the alchemist and is prevalent basically everywhere.

