He says Jung is a very big fan of compensation. When you go too far in one direction, the other direction will also automatically be generated just to keep a balance.

00:28:35.820 --> 00:28:58.765
So Christianity was this very strong view inside and disregarding the outside created the counterbalance in alchemy where people looked rather outside and Christianity had a very strong dogmatic view where everything is laid out like this is the world, this is how it works. You have to believe it.

