Even all the saints who had all those individual revelations, First were heretics. They were seen as heretics and very often they were killed then as martyrs. This was only then later they say, oh, okay, yeah, maybe they were saintly, maybe they were important for Christianity. And this is a big no-no of Christianity to have this individual revelation.

00:29:41.555 --> 00:30:05.332
